[en.CHARACTER_OCTAVIA_NAME]
Octavia

[en.CHARACTER_OCTAVIA_DESC]
Octavia loves music, and she loves peace. She hopes that the ponies of Ponyville can always enjoy music peacefully.
She doesn’t understand why the world is full of noise; she doesn’t understand why the residents of Ponyville are suffering; and she absolutely doesn’t understand why her cutie mark is a treble clef while she’s a cellist.

[zh.CHARACTER_OCTAVIA_NAME]
奥塔薇娅

[zh.CHARACTER_OCTAVIA_DESC]
奥塔薇娅热爱音乐，也热爱和平，她希望小马谷的小马们都可以一直平静地享受音乐。
她不明白为什么世界上充斥着噪音；她不明白为什么小马谷的居民们遭受着苦难；她也更不明白为什么她作为一个大提琴演奏家，可爱标志却是高音谱号。
